{
    "title": "AiScore - Live Sports Scores",
    "description": "AiScore is your LIVESCORE EXPERT. More information, more statistics and a completely new experience on your smartphone. Here you are even informed faster than the TV viewers! \r\n\r\nIn-depth coverage of basketball, baseball, hockey, American football, tennis and soccer, AiScore keeps you well informed of live scores, goals, red or yellow card, head-to-head comparison, schedules and other important statistics at top speed. \r\n\r\nAiScore brings you live data, team and player stats, standings, tables and Lineups from NBA Basketball, CBA Basketball, FIBA Basketball, English Premier League football, La Liga football, Champions League football, WTA tennis, ATP tennis, MLB baseball - major or small leagues and competitions all over the world! \r\n\r\n\r\nTOP HIGHLIGHTS:\r\n\r\n*All Games - Follow all today's matches in real time. Also, you can check out the matches on specific day by DateTime Picker.\r\n\r\n*Live - Stay up to date with all the latest scores and results from hundreds and thousands of games worldwide. Every score at a glance. Just tap the matchup for Box Score or Lineups, H2H and Match Live.\r\n\r\n*Favorites - Choose your favorite team and competition on matchup and always be up-to-date.\r\n\r\n*Instant Notification - Get instant notifications of goal, corner, red or yellow card, start, starting lineups and final results for all live or your followed matches. A pop-up window will appear to inform you of score changing when you turn on the \"Score Reminder\u201d.\r\n\r\n*Leagues - In-depth coverage of leagues, cups and tournaments from over 200 countries. Check out latest rankings, standings, team or player stats and more.\r\n\r\nBasketball: Over 500 tournaments including FIBA Basketball World Cup, NBA, CBA\r\n\r\nBaseball: Complete souce for worldwide baseball matches including MLB World Series, KBO\r\n\r\nTennis: Complete source for worldwide tennis matches including ATP, WTA\r\n\r\nSoccer: over 2600 tournaments and 37000 teams (FIFA World Cup, Premier League, Champions League, Serie A, La Liga, Bundesliga, MLS, FA Cup, League Cup, Europa League, Ligue 1, Coppa Italia, Copa Del Rey, Liga MX, UEFA European Championships and more)\r\n\r\n*Chatroom - Get connected with other sports fans from all over the world. No game is boring if you can chat live.\r\n\r\n*Language - 28 (more will be added)\r\n\r\n\"Need help? Email service@aiscore.com or Tap \"Feedback\"\r\n\r\nWe are affiliated with aiscore.com\r\n\r\nStay Tuned:\r\n\r\nFacebook: @Aiscoreapp\r\n\r\nTwitter: @aiscoreofficial\r\n\r\nInstagram: @aiscore_official\r\n\r\nFor developers, please contact www.thesports.com for sports data solution.\r\n\r\nFor business inquiry, email business@aiscore.com",
